Z||000009||JSocha||09-24-2001||12:47 AM||||Look at what some telemarkerting firms have been doing.<P>Recently, they had a report that if a telemarkerter calls in regards to assisting in relief for WTC, to contact your local authorities and state officials after getting an 800 number, because what they are doing is absolutely illegal.<P>However, when it comes to telemarketing firms, most 800 numbers are unlisted and change frequently as my wife brought to my attention as she use to work for an outgoing telemarketing firm many, many years ago.  So how are they going to trace the number?<P>Anyways, its sad when people take advantage of others in this way.<P>Barnamn at least had it right in his comment, "There is a sucker born every minute", and that is what people like this do, prey on the ignorance and emotions of others for self serving interests.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||8
